doona-Android sketch: third-party material

Noto Sans TC (app/src/main/res/font/noto_sans_tc_w*.ttf)
Subset and fixed-weight instances of the variable font in @fontsource-variable/noto-sans-tc 5.3.0, as doona ships
it, built by tools/fonts.py. Copyright 2014-2021 Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/), with Reserved Font Name 'Source'.
SIL Open Font License 1.1: app/src/main/assets/licenses/noto-sans-tc-OFL.txt

Inter 4.001 (app/src/debug/res/font/rv_inter_*.ttf, the prototype/rv sample only)
Fixed-weight instances (opsz 14 and 32) and a Latin subset of Inter[opsz,wght].ttf from google/fonts ofl/inter.
Copyright 2020 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter).
SIL Open Font License 1.1: app/src/debug/assets/licenses/inter-OFL.txt

Material Symbols Rounded (app/src/debug/res/drawable/rv_ic_*.xml, the prototype/rv sample only)
Copyright Google LLC. Weight 600, filled, 24 px SVGs from Google Fonts' icon release
(fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/materialsymbolsrounded); paths unchanged, converted to vector drawables.
Apache License 2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Natural Earth land (app/src/debug/kotlin/dev/doona/android/prototype/rv/RvLandMask.kt, the prototype/rv sample only)
A 2-degree grid that tools/rv_land_mask.py rasterizes from ne_110m_land.geojson, Natural Earth 1:110m v5.1.2
(https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector). Public domain: https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/

Adobe Spectrum 2 icons (app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_*.xml except ic_duck.xml)
Copyright 2024 Adobe. Adapted from @react-spectrum/s2 through doona src/ui/icons; geometry unchanged, converted to
vector drawables by tools/icons.py. Apache License 2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Twemoji flags (app/src/main/res/drawable/flag_*.xml)
Copyright Twitter, Inc and other contributors, taken from doona's Twemoji Country Flags font
(src/ui/assets/TwemojiCountryFlags.woff2). CC-BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

doona duck mark (app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_duck.xml)
From doona src/logo.svg.
